    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>gorepunk</strong> is a bloody\u00a0hopeful eco-punk RPG where recycling is religion, and humanity thrives in the corpse of a dead titan.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a unique world of blood, guts and hope as you navigate the unliving god-city of Markoth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623700/extras/63a63632bd2c9176d54f81e044157a55.poster.avif?t=1743593401\" width=754 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623700/extras/63a63632bd2c9176d54f81e044157a55.webm?t=1743593401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623700/extras/63a63632bd2c9176d54f81e044157a55.mp4?t=1743593401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a deep dialogue system with impactful choices affecting relationships, locations, and quests.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623700/extras/3402498dcd35c0bb4b8e3af5656b925d.poster.avif?t=1743593401\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623700/extras/3402498dcd35c0bb4b8e3af5656b925d.webm?t=1743593401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623700/extras/3402498dcd35c0bb4b8e3af5656b925d.mp4?t=1743593401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Utilize a TTRPG-inspired ability and dice roll system to manage your daily actions and resources.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623700/extras/b37e7b8d273fd86e2a039da9e228023f.poster.avif?t=1743593401\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623700/extras/b37e7b8d273fd86e2a039da9e228023f.webm?t=1743593401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623700/extras/b37e7b8d273fd86e2a039da9e228023f.mp4?t=1743593401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge deep connections with a diverse cast, and spend influence to impact their lives and unlock new areas.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623700/extras/f3c4a4d85b216fc25558ae77d88eb993.poster.avif?t=1743593401\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623700/extras/f3c4a4d85b216fc25558ae77d88eb993.webm?t=1743593401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623700/extras/f3c4a4d85b216fc25558ae77d88eb993.mp4?t=1743593401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
